\section{Results}
\label{sec:results}
\paragraph{Overview}
In this section, we evaluate the performance of the proposed Equi-Euler GraphNet framework on the case study presented in Section~\ref{sec:case_study}, with a focus on two  core  tasks: predicting pairwise contact forces and generating trajectory rollouts for each bearing component in a cylindrical roller bearing.
