\begin{abstract}
An increasing number of DeFi protocols are gaining popularity, facilitating transactions among multiple anonymous users. 
State Manipulation is one of the notorious attacks in DeFi smart contracts, with price variable being the most commonly exploited state variable—attackers manipulate token prices to gain illicit profits.
