Our proposed method aligns the representations from the three modalities by jointly optimizing the visual-text ($L_{\text{vt}}$), audio-text ($L_{\text{at}}$), and audio-visual ($L_{\text{av}}$) contrastive losses. % when training the encoders that learn the representations. 
