\subsection{Analytical Approach}

We apply a three-step analysis workflow, as presented in Fig. \ref{fig:research_flow}. First, we retrieve and cross-reference contextual data from DBLP, Scopus, and Journal Citation Reports (JCR). Then, we apply our formal model to the data and analyze the publication distributions and their associated HVs (when applicable). Finally, we explore the underlying dynamics of HVs through cluster-based analysis. 

