Finally, LAMs facilitate network optimization by dynamically allocating resources based on user intents.
Habib \emph{et al.} \cite{Opt2} presented an LAM-enhanced resource allocation scheme, in which LAMs are leveraged to classify user intent and feed extracted terms into the DRL.
