Now, fix some arbitrary $j\in [d]$. The coefficient of $\E_{F_1,\dots,F_{j-1},F_{j+1},\dots,F_d\sim \mu^{-j}} \Var_{\mu_{F_1,\dots,F_{j-1},F_{j+1},\dots,F_d}}(f)$ is 
\begin{align*}
    &\beta \left(\sum_{i=1}^{j-1} \frac{(j-i)(d+1-j)}{d} + \sum_{i=j+1}^d \frac{j\cdot (i-j)}{d}\right) \\
