\section{Conclusions} 

The key contribution of existing work in this area is on bridging the gap between informal natural language descriptions and rigorous formal specifications. In VERIFAI, we aim to improve the techniques that bridge this gap, through  refinement of prompt engineering, the incorporation of chain-of-thought reasoning and the development of hybrid neuro-symbolic approaches.

